msgctxt "2\t171"
msgid ""
"Now aware of the truth, Haruka and I\\n"
"headed to where the money lay⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "178\t245"
msgid "⑬Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460\t548"
msgid "We found Yumi waiting for us there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "571\t672"
msgid "And as it turned out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "730\t781"
msgid "...she was also Haruka's mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816\t884"
msgid "At last, mother and daughter were reunited."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "905\t1030"
msgid "But this happy moment would not last long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100\t1124"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1323\t1477"
msgid ""
"Jingu Kyohei had come to take back his\\n"
"10 billion yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1479\t1670"
msgid ""
"He had betrayed the Tojo Clan and joined\\n"
"with the Omi Alliance from Osaka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1684\t1820"
msgid ""
"He was trying to control both the yakuza\\n"
"and the government."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1830\t2032"
msgid ""
"Jingu tricked Terada, a friend of my\\n"
"father's who was in the Omi Alliance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2101\t2182"
msgid "...and confronted us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2264\t2296"
msgid "However..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2383\t2400"
msgid "What?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2401\t2420"
msgid "Yumi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2440\t2510"
msgid "You can't shoot me now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2520\t2654"
msgid ""
"If this explodes, the 10 billion yen will\\n"
"go with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2670\t2715"
msgid "Yumi's desperate courage..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2732\t2830"
msgid ""
"...and my father's strength helped me\\n"
"do what had to be done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2831\t2993"
msgid ""
"I am Kazuma Kiryu.\\n"
"Fourth chairman of the Tojo Clan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3015\t3117"
msgid "We were able to defeat Jingu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3273\t3466"
msgid "But just as we thought everything was over..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3476\t3593"
msgid ""
"I guess it's all over, eh?\\n"
"Finally, we'll have some peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3606\t3630"
msgid "Nishiki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3665\t3783"
msgid "The past ten years had changed us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4186\t4255"
msgid "We had no choice but to fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4293\t4317"
msgid "And then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4970\t5096"
msgid "...my best friend sacrificed his life..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5111\t5149"
msgid "...to save Haruka and me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5776\t5924"
msgid "My father, Yumi, and Nishiki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5944\t6097"
msgid ""
"I had lost everyone.\\n"
"I had lost the will to live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6110\t6275"
msgid ""
"Snap out of it!\\n"
"You've still got something to fight for!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6295\t6434"
msgid ""
"There's someone who needs you!\\n"
"Don't run from your responsibilities!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6448\t6589"
msgid ""
"I regained the will to live with the help\\n"
"of Date..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6607\t6655"
msgid "...and Haruka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6719\t6924"
msgid ""
"I gave the title of chairman to Terada,\\n"
"who would carry on after my father..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6929\t7008"
msgid "...and left the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7059\t7251"
msgid "I decided to start a new life with Haruka."
msgstr ""